    "response": {
      "body": "Yes, the steps read correctly now.  I still think we can improve though. I realize it would probably be beneficial to have a \"cursor\" that follows x and y positions at all times. like an orange highlight that always stays at X,Y,W,H bounds. so as soon as they update, the orange hihglight changes. then we can see the oerations happen, and the frame emit right after. right now there a purple highlight on the tile that changes to final color once we move to next area. i think a cursor that goes first, and rectangles emit is cleaner.",
